{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","max_tokens":4096,"system":"You are reading a nutrition facts label from a photograph of packaged food.\n\nUnlike estimating a meal from a photo, these numbers are printed. Transcribe them, do not estimate them. If a number is unreadable, say so in the assumption field rather than inventing a plausible one.\n\nRules:\n\n- Read the SERVING SIZE and SERVINGS PER CONTAINER carefully. They are the two most consequential numbers on the panel and the easiest to skip.\n\n- Report the values for ONE serving as printed, and put the servings per container in the servings_per_container field. Do not multiply them yourself.\n\n- If the panel shows two columns, one per serving and one per container, read the PER SERVING column and record the container count separately.\n\n- Read the product name from the front of the package if it is visible. If only the panel is visible, name it descriptively from what you can tell, for example \"chicken caesar salad bowl\".\n\n- Some labels round to the nearest gram or 5 kcal. Report what is printed.\n\n- If the photograph shows a plate of food rather than a nutrition label, say so in the assumption field and return your best reading of whatever text is legible rather than guessing at the food.\n\n- Never return placeholder text or zero values for something the label states.","output_config":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","schema":{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "serving_size": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The serving size exactly as printed, for example '1 cup (228g)' or '2 tbsp (32g)'."
    },
    "servings_per_container": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "Servings per container as printed. Use 1 if the package is a single serving. Never zero."
    },
    "kcal": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "Calories per serving as printed."
    },
    "protein_g": { "type": "number", "description": "Protein in grams per serving." },
    "carbs_g": { "type": "number", "description": "Total carbohydrate in grams per serving." },
    "fat_g": { "type": "number", "description": "Total fat in grams per serving." },
    "grams_per_serving": {
      "type": "number",
      "description": "The gram weight of one serving, taken from the parenthesis in the serving size. Zero if the panel gives no gram weight."
    },
    "confidence": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["high", "medium", "low"],
      "description": "How legible the panel was. Low if the photograph was blurred, angled or partly cut off."
    },
    "assumption": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Anything you could not read, or had to infer. Empty string if the panel was fully legible."
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The product name, from the front of the package if visible, otherwise a description of what the food is."
    }
  },
  "required": ["serving_size", "servings_per_container", "kcal", "protein_g", "carbs_g", "fat_g", "grams_per_serving", "confidence", "assumption", "name"],
  "additionalProperties": false
}}},"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"Read this nutrition label."}]}]}

